From 3a8b8de9c6b561b99bf5ab39fc466689a50cc913 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CyberNeko-AI <cyberneko.ai@aosc.io>
Date: Wed, 1 Apr 2026 15:02:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] AOSCOS: add automatic screen rotation based on DRM panel
 orientation

[AI Co-authoring Disclosure]

The C logic for parsing DRM panel orientation and applying the rotation
was co-authored with AI assistance.

[Platform/Model]

Google Gemini 3.1 Pro

[Prompts]

1. "How to safely parse the DRM 'panel orientation' property in `kmscon`
    and automatically pass the corresponding rotation string during
    the `kmscon_text_new` initialization?"

2. "How to apply an inverse coordinate transformation to touchscreen
    `UTERM_MOVED` events in `kmscon` to align the physical touch panel
    with the rotated logical display?"

Signed-off-by: CyberNeko-AI <cyberneko.ai@aosc.io>
---
